commit 62ad305a4edf6b4d919627db44c5f0e9bf79cb54
Author: iseeheaven <iseeheaven@outlook.com>
Date:   Fri Jul 24 19:03:30 2026 +0000

    v0.6.100: fix pixel validation reading wrong pixel on HiDPI devices

    Root cause: getImageData uses raw backing-store coordinates, but validation
    was passing p5-space coordinates without accounting for pixelDensity().
    On 2x/3x devices the wrong pixel was sampled, causing false failures.

    Fix: multiply validation coordinates by p5Instance.pixelDensity() so
    getImageData reads the correct physical pixel.

    Entire-Checkpoint: de095acc37f8

